Description: Fits bivariate Cluster-Weighted Models (CWM) where each
    component is described by a pair of Generalized Additive Models for
    Location, Scale and Shape ('GAMLSS') distributions: one for the covariate
    X and one for the conditional response Y | X. Parameters are estimated
    via the Expectation-Maximisation (EM) algorithm, using the 'gamlss'
    package for the component models. The package provides
    S3 methods for summarising, predicting and plotting fitted models, as
    well as contour visualisation of the mixture density.
